      "content": "i dont really want to go to the doctor if i dont have to, thats so expensive and annoying. the drops aren't even that old, maybe like 4 months passed the date. if i just use a couple drops now to clean it out and kill any bacteria from the soap, won't that be better than just letting it sit there and risk an infection? i feel like it's just a minor sting anyway.",
